WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Narrator: Some football moments change a crowd fast.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:12.900
Narrator: A goal: people surge forward, rush down stairs, climb, sometimes light flares - report it, never handle it.

3
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:22.300
Narrator: Rivalry: scarves, chants, and rival groups meeting on concourses or on the way out - stay neutral and report groups gathering.

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:32.700
Narrator: Late goals and the final whistle cause sudden movement - stay in position and watch the stairs.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.100
Narrator: And big matches bring bigger emotions.

